## Field Consumption Reference

| Field | Bark | A2A | Face-to-face |
|-------|:----:|:---:|:------------:|
| `AmbientBarkPrompt.VoiceAndAttitude` | ✔ | ✔ | — |
| `AmbientBarkPrompt.SpokenHabits` | ✔ | ✔ | — |
| `AmbientBarkPrompt.ObservationLenses` | ✔ | — | — |
| `ProgressStates[].Text` | — | ✔ | ✔ |
| `ProgressStates[].BarkMindset` | ✔ | — | — |
| `ProgressStates[].Preoccupations` | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |
| Root `Preoccupations` (fallback) | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |

Use this table when deciding where a new field belongs. If a field describes "who the character is," it is shared. If it describes "what the character is noticing alone," it is Bark-only.

